      "sketch": "The `describe_customer` method accesses `customer.customer_id()`, `customer.name()`, `customer.email()`, and `customer.tier()`. This is a classic case of feature envy. Moving this logic to a `Customer` method (e.g., `customer.format_for_report()`) or a dedicated `CustomerPresenter` would reduce the dependency of `ReportView` on the internal structure of `Customer` and improve cohesion by grouping related data access and formatting together."
